---
layout: base.njk
title: AJ Weeks
---

<section class="intro">
  <p class="bio">
    I'm a software engineer with a strong interest in technical AI Safety and a strong understanding of modern realtime graphics programming. I'm currently transitioning into technical AI safety research.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="selected-writings">
  <h2>Selected Writings</h2>
  <ul class="selected-writings-list">
    {%- for post in collections.post %}
      {%- if "selected" in post.data.tags %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a><br>
        <span class="post-desc">{{ post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long' }) }} — {{ post.data.description }}</span>
      </li>
      {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>